n ọja','Open image: %s'=>'Ṣii aworan: %s','Open image'=>'Ṣii aworan','Enlarge image: %s'=>'Fa aworan pọ si: %s','Enlarge image'=>'Fa aworan pọ si','Play video: %s'=>'Ṣe ere fidio: %s','Play video'=>'Ṣe ere fidio','Image viewer'=>'Olugbala aworan','Video player'=>'Olugbala fidio','Close'=>'Pa','Previous'=>'Ti tẹlẹ','Next'=>'Tẹle','Image {current} of {total}'=>'Aworan {current} ti {total}','Table of contents'=>'Akojọ ak contenidos','Social link'=>'Sošialìnkì','Icon link'=>'Ikon lìnkì','Discover Auto Insert fields'=>'Ṣawari ààyè Auto Insert','Discover Auto Insert rule fields and Free/Pro positions, post types and taxonomies. Use list-reusable-blocks to choose a block ID. Specific block targeting and extra placement/author/date/post restrictions require Pro.'=>'Ṣawari ààyè ofin Auto Insert ati awọn ipo Free/Pro, awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ati taxonomy. Lo atokọ-reusable-blocks lati yan ID bulọọki. Idojuko bulọọki pato ati afikun ipo / onkọwe / ọjọ / ifiweranṣẹ awọn ihamọ nilo Pro.','Create or update Auto Insert rule'=>'Ṣẹda tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn ofin Auto Insert','Create a draft Auto Insert rule or update one verified rule ID. Title and reusable block ID are required on create. Only supplied fields change. Setting status publish makes insertion active. Free/Pro targeting and object permissions are enforced.'=>'Ṣẹda àkóónú àtẹle Auto Insert tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn ID ofin ti a fọwọsi kan. Akọle ati ID bulọọki ti a tun lo jẹ dandan lori ṣẹda. Awọn aaye ti a pese nikan ni yipada. Ṣeto ipo atẹjade n ṣe ifihan ṣiṣẹ. Idojuko Free/Pro ati awọn igbanilaaye ohun jẹ dandan.','Trash Auto Insert rule'=>'Ibi idasilẹ ofin Auto Insert','Move a verified Auto Insert rule to Trash to stop its insertion. Does not delete the reusable block or change other rules.'=>'Gbe ofin Auto Insert ti a fọwọsi si Ibi idasilẹ lati da ifihan rẹ duro. Kii ṣe pa bulọọki ti a tun lo tabi yipada awọn ofin miiran.','Auto Insert rule not found.'=>'Ofin Auto Insert ko ri.','A title and reusable block ID are required.'=>'Akọle kan ati ID bulọọki ti a tun lo jẹ dandan.','Cannot publish insertion rules.'=>'Ko le gbe awọn ofin ifihan.','Choose an editable reusable block ID.'=>'Yan ID bulọọki ti a tun lo ti o le ṣe atunṣe.','Publish the selected reusable block before activating its insertion rule.'=>'Tẹsiwaju bulọọki ti a yan ki o to mu ofin ifihan rẹ ṣiṣẹ.','Unknown or inaccessible target post type.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ ibi ti a ko mọ tabi ti ko le wọle si.','Unknown, inaccessible or Pro-only taxonomy.'=>'Ko mọ, ko le wọle si tabi taxonomy nikan Pro.','Unknown term ID.'=>'ID ọrọ ti ko mọ.','Unknown or inaccessible author ID.'=>'ID onkọwe ti ko mọ tabi ti ko le wọle si.','Unknown or inaccessible target post ID.'=>'ID ifiweranṣẹ ibi ti a ko mọ tabi ti ko le wọle si.','Unknown targeted block name.'=>'Orukọ bulọọki ti a fojusi ti ko mọ.','Trash is disabled on this site. Use WordPress to permanently delete this object.'=>'Ibi idasilẹ ti wa ni pipade lori aaye yii. Lo WordPress lati pa ohun yii ni pipe.','Rule could not be trashed.'=>'Ofin ko le wa ni ibi idasilẹ.','Discover block attributes'=>'Ṣawari awọn abuda bulọọki','Read one registered or captured editor block type by exact name, including native attribute schemas, defaults, labels and supports. Includes core and Pro types available on this site. Open Block Permissions to refresh client-only schema snapshots.'=>'Ka iru bulọọki olootu kan ti a forukọsilẹ tabi ti a mu ka nipasẹ orukọ gangan, pẹlu awọn apẹrẹ abuda abinibi, awọn aiyipada, awọn aami ati atilẹyin. Ni awọn iru core ati Pro ti o wa lori aaye yii. Ṣii Awọn igbanilaaye Bulọọki lati tunṣe awọn aworan akosilẹ ti alabara nikan.','Read fresh block usage counts from a bounded page of editable posts, including nested blocks. Returns IDs, post types and counts without post content. Optionally filter by a known block name. Totals cover this page only; continue all pages for a site inventory.'=>'Ka awọn iṣiro lilo bulọọki tuntun lati oju-iwe ti a fi opin si ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a le ṣe atunṣe, pẹlu awọn bulọọki ti a gbe sinu. Nṣiṣẹ ID, awọn iru ifiweranṣẹ ati awọn iṣiro laisi akoonu ifiweranṣẹ. Yiyan jẹ ki o fa nipasẹ orukọ bulọọki ti a mọ. Awọn apapọ bo oju-iwe yii nikan; tẹsiwaju gbogbo awọn oju-iwe fun iṣiro aaye.','Read editable post blocks'=>'Ka awọn bulọọki ifiweranṣẹ ti a le satunkọ','Read an editable post as serialized blocks with exact nested paths and a content hash. Includes content, attributes and saved Blocks editor preferences. Does not expand reusable references. Use the hash when editing to avoid overwriting newer content.'=>'Ka ifiweranṣẹ ti a le satunkọ gẹgẹbi awọn bulọọki ti a ti kọ silẹ pẹlu awọn ọna abayo to tọ ati hash akoonu. Awọn akoonu, awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ ati awọn ayanfẹ olootu Blocks ti a fipamọ ni a gba. Ko fa awọn itọkasi ti a le tun lo. Lo hash nigba ti o ba n ṣatunkọ lati yago fun fifọ akoonu tuntun.','Edit one post block'=>'Ṣatunkọ bulọọki ifiweranṣẹ kan','Replace, remove or insert one serialized block at an exact path from get-post-blocks. Alternatively set_visibility changes only native advgbBlockControls. Requires the last content hash. Preserves other blocks and post fields; native WordPress save sanitization and permissions apply.'=>'Rọpo, yọkuro tabi fi bulọọki ti a ti kọ silẹ kan sinu ọna to tọ lati get-post-blocks. Ni omiiran, set_visibility n yipada nikan native advgbBlockControls. Nilo hash akoonu ti o kẹhin. N ṣe idasilẹ awọn bulọọki miiran ati awọn aaye ifiweranṣẹ; awọn ilana fipamọ WordPress abinibi ati awọn igbanilaaye lo.','Assign saved style to one post block'=>'Yan aṣa ti a fipamọ si bulọọki ifiweranṣẹ kan','Apply a saved Block Style ID to an exact block path from get-post-blocks, or remove its saved style. Updates native customStyle and identifyColor attributes and saved wrapper markup, preserving other classes and content. Requires the latest content hash and editable post permissions. Block Styles must be enabled.'=>'Lo ID Aṣa Block ti a fipamọ si ọna bulọọki to tọ lati get-post-blocks, tabi yọkuro aṣa ti a fipamọ rẹ. N ṣe imudojuiwọn native customStyle ati awọn ẹya identifyColor ati aami wrapper ti a fipamọ, n ṣetọju awọn kilasi ati akoonu miiran. Nilo hash akoonu tuntun julọ ati awọn igbanilaaye ifiweranṣẹ ti a le satunkọ. Awọn Aṣa Block gbọdọ jẹ mu ṣiṣẹ.','Find reusable blocks and synced patterns'=>'Wa awọn bulọọki ti a le tun lo ati awọn ilana ti o ni ibamu','Find editable reusable blocks (wp_block), with IDs, titles and status, for Auto Insert or editing. Read one with get-post-blocks. Results are paginated.'=>'Wa awọn bulọọki ti a le tun lo (wp_block), pẹlu awọn ID, awọn akọle ati ipo, fun Auto Insert tabi ṣiṣatunkọ. Ka ọkan pẹlu get-post-blocks. Awọn esi ti wa ni paginated.','Create or update reusable block'=>'Ṣẹda tabi imudojuiwọn bulọọki ti a le tun lo','Create a reusable block or synced pattern, or update a verified ID. New objects require title and serialized block content and default to draft. Existing content changes require expected_hash from get-post-blocks. Other fields are preserved.'=>'Ṣẹda bulọọki ti a le tun lo tabi ilana ti o ni ibamu, tabi imudojuiwọn ID ti a fọwọsi. Awọn ohun tuntun nilo akọle ati akoonu bulọọki ti a ti kọ silẹ ati pe wọn da lori draft. Awọn ayipada akoonu ti o wa nilo expected_hash lati get-post-blocks. Awọn aaye miiran ni a fipamọ.','Trash reusable block'=>'Yọ bulọọki ti a le tun lo sinu ibi idọti','Trash a verified reusable block ID using native WordPress permissions. Existing references are not rewritten; check Auto Insert and post usage first.'=>'Yọ ID bulọọki ti a le tun lo ti a fọwọsi sinu ibi idọti nipa lilo awọn igbanilaaye WordPress abinibi. Awọn itọkasi ti o wa ko ni tun kọ; ṣayẹwo Auto Insert ati lilo ifiweranṣẹ akọkọ.','Read Post Notes'=>'Ka Awọn akọsilẹ Ifiweranṣẹ','Read native WordPress notes for an editable post, or omit post_id to list across editable posts with edit_others_posts and moderate_comments. Native REST permissions and per-post edit permissions apply. Omits author emails and IP addresses. Results are paginated.'=>'Ka awọn akọsilẹ WordPress abinibi fun ifiweranṣẹ ti a le satunkọ, tabi yọ post_id kuro lati ṣe atokọ kọja awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a le satunkọ pẹlu edit_others_posts ati moderate_comments. Awọn igbanilaaye REST abinibi ati awọn igbanilaaye ifiweranṣẹ kọọkan lo. O yọkuro awọn imeeli onkọwe ati awọn adirẹsi IP. Awọn esi ti wa ni paginated.','Create, edit or resolve Post Note'=>'Ṣẹda, ṣatunkọ tabi yanju Akọsilẹ Ifiweranṣẹ','Create a note on an editable post, edit its content, reply to a note or resolve/reopen a verified note. Requires native note permissions. New notes need content. Note identity and post must match.'=>'Ṣẹda akọsilẹ lori ifiweranṣẹ ti a le satunkọ, ṣatunkọ akoonu rẹ, fesi si akọsilẹ kan tabi yanju / tun ṣi ifiweranṣẹ ti a fọwọsi. Nilo awọn igbanilaaye akọsilẹ abinibi. Awọn akọsilẹ tuntun nilo akoonu. Idanimọ akọsilẹ ati ifiweranṣẹ gbọdọ baamu.','Trash Post Note'=>'Yọ Akọsilẹ Ifiweranṣẹ sinu ibi idọti','Trash a verified note belonging to the requested editable post. Native comment/note deletion permissions apply.'=>'Yọ akọsilẹ ti a fọwọsi ti o jẹ ti ifiweranṣẹ ti a beere sinu ibi idọti. Awọn igbanilaaye piparẹ akọsilẹ / akọsilẹ abinibi lo.','Choose an accessible REST-enabled post type.'=>'Yan iru ifiweranṣẹ ti o wa ni REST-enabled.','Unknown block name.'=>'Orukọ bulọọki ti a ko mọ.','Unknown block type. Refresh the native editor catalogue.'=>'Iru bulọọki ti a ko mọ. Tun katalogi olootu abinibi ṣe.','This post exceeds the 200 KB block editing limit. Use the WordPress editor.'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ yii kọja 200 KB bulọọki iṣatunkọ opin. Lo olootu WordPress.','This post is too deeply nested or too large to list block by block. Use the WordPress editor.'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ yii ti wa ni inaro ju tabi tobi ju lati ṣe atokọ bulọọki nipasẹ bulọọki. Lo olootu WordPress.','Post changed. Read get-post-blocks again before editing.'=>'Ifiweranṣẹ ti yipada. Ka get-post-blocks lẹẹkansi ṣaaju ṣiṣatunkọ.','Supply one complete serialized block.'=>'Pese bulọọki ti a ti kọ silẹ kan ti o pe.','Use exactly one known serialized block.'=>'Lo bulọọki ti a ti kọ silẹ kan ti a mọ gaan.','Block Controls must be enabled and visibility supplied.'=>'Awọn iṣakoso bulọọki gbọdọ jẹ mu ṣiṣẹ ati pe a gbọdọ pese iran.','The proposed edit exceeds the 200 KB block editing limit.'=>'Iṣatunkọ ti a dabaa kọja 200 KB bulọọki iṣatunkọ opin.','Unknown or unavailable Pro block type.'=>'Iru bulọọki Pro ti a ko mọ tabi ti ko wa.','This block does not support custom styles.'=>'Bulọọki yii ko ṣe atilẹyin awọn aṣa aṣa.','Choose an existing style with a valid class name.'=>'Yan aṣa to wa pẹlu orukọ kilasi ti o wulo.','This block has no supported HTML wrapper for style assignment.'=>'Bulọọki yii ko ni wrapper HTML ti a ṣe atilẹyin fun iforukọsilẹ aṣa.','Block path does not exist. Read get-post-blocks again.'=>'Ọna bulọọki ko si. Ka get-post-blocks lẹẹkansi.','Post type is not editable through its native REST controller.'=>'Iru ifiweranṣẹ ko le jẹ satunkọ nipasẹ olutọju REST abinibi rẹ.','Unsupported native post controller.'=>'Olutọju ifiweranṣẹ abinibi ti ko ni atilẹyin.','Cannot edit this post.'=>'Ko le satunkọ ifiweranṣẹ yii.','Reusable block not found or not editable.'=>'Bulọọki ti a le tun lo ko ri tabi ko le satunkọ.','Read get-post-blocks and supply the latest expected_hash.'=>'Ka get-post-blocks ki o si pese expected_hash tuntun julọ.','Title and serialized content are required.'=>'Akọle ati akoonu ti a ti kọ silẹ jẹ dandan.','Cannot create reusable blocks.'=>'Ko le ṣẹda awọn bulọọki ti a le tun lo.','Cannot delete this reusable block.'=>'Ko le paarẹ blok ti a le tun lo yii.','Could not trash reusable block.'=>'Ko le ṣe idọti blok ti a le tun lo.','Note ID and post do not match.'=>'ID akọsilẹ ko ba ipo mu.','A new note needs content.'=>'Akọsilẹ tuntun nilo akoonu.','Resolve or reopen an existing note ID.'=>'Yan tabi tun ṣi ID akọsilẹ to wa.','The note status changed, but its audit entry and status rollback failed. Read the note before retrying.'=>'Ipo akọsilẹ ti yipada, ṣugbọn iforukọsilẹ ayẹwo rẹ ati atunṣe ipo kuna. Ka akọsilẹ naa ṣaaju ki o to tun gbiyanju.','Discover Blocks feature settings'=>'Ṣawari awọn eto ẹya awọn Blok','Read supported settings and exact schemas for Extra Blocks switches, per-block controls, legacy blocks, role Editor Features, form email, reCAPTCHA or Content Display thumbnail. editor-features requires role. API keys are never returned.'=>'Ka awọn eto ti a ṣe atilẹyin ati awọn apẹrẹ gangan fun awọn switch Extra Blocks, iṣakoso fun ọkọọkan blok, awọn blok atijọ, awọn ẹya olootu iṣẹ, fọọmu imeeli, reCAPTCHA tabi aworan akoonu. awọn ẹya olootu nilo ipa. Awọn bọtini API ko ni pada.','Update Blocks feature settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto ẹya awọn Blok','Change only supplied settings in one discovered feature. Use dry_run to validate and return proposed settings without saving. Preserves other roles and values, validates every field before saving and rejects unknown blocks or Pro-only blocks in Free. Does not accept API keys or arbitrary options.'=>'Yipada nikan awọn eto ti a pese ni ẹya kan ti a ti ṣawari. Lo dry_run lati jẹrisi ati pada awọn eto ti a dabaa laisi fipamọ. Pa awọn ipa ati awọn iye miiran, jẹrisi gbogbo aaye ṣaaju ki o to fipamọ ati kọ awọn blok ti a ko mọ tabi awọn blok Pro nikan ni Free. Ko gba awọn bọtini API tabi awọn aṣayan airotẹlẹ.','Update post editor preferences'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn ayanfẹ olootu ifiweranṣẹ','Set one editable post editor width or columns visual guide. Empty strings inherit global settings. Other post metadata and content are preserved.'=>'Ṣeto iwọn olootu ifiweranṣẹ ti a le satunkọ kan tabi itọsọna wiwo awọn ọwọn. Awọn okun ofo gba awọn eto agbaye. Awọn metadata ifiweranṣẹ miiran ati akoonu ni a pa.','Read saved form submissions'=>'Ka awọn ifisilẹ fọọmu ti a fipamọ','Read saved Contact Form or Newsletter names, email addresses and messages for authorized export. Requires native settings/export capabilities and Extra Blocks enabled. Results are paginated; no email is sent.'=>'Ka awọn orukọ Fọọmu Ibaraẹnisọrọ ti a fipamọ tabi awọn orukọ Iwe iroyin, awọn adirẹsi imeeli ati awọn ifiranṣẹ fun ẹtọ export. Nilo awọn eto abinibi / agbara export ati Extra Blocks ti muu ṣiṣẹ. Awọn abajade ni a pin si awọn oju iwe; ko si imeeli ti a firanṣẹ.','Count saved form submissions'=>'Ka awọn ifisilẹ fọọmu ti a fipamọ','Read counts of saved Contact Form and Newsletter submissions. Does not expose any submitted names, email addresses or message content.'=>'Ka awọn iṣiro ti awọn ifisilẹ Fọọmu Ibaraẹnisọrọ ati Iwe iroyin ti a fipamọ. Ko ṣafihan eyikeyi awọn orukọ ti a fi silẹ, awọn adirẹsi imeeli tabi akoonu ifiranṣẹ.','Choose an existing role.'=>'Yan ipa to wa.','Use true or false for checkbox settings.'=>'Lo otito tabi irọ fun awọn eto akojọ ayẹwo.','Unknown or Pro-only block.'=>'Blok ti a ko mọ tabi Pro nikan.','Choose an editable media attachment.'=>'Yan asopọ media ti a le satunkọ.','Configure reCAPTCHA keys in WordPress before enabling it.'=>'Ṣeto awọn bọtini reCAPTCHA ni WordPress ṣaaju ki o to mu ṣiṣẹ.','Supply at least one editor preference.'=>'Pese o kere ju ọkan ninu awọn ayanfẹ olootu.','Each visibility rule needs a control type.'=>'Gbogbo ofin wiwo nilo iru iṣakoso kan.','Unknown visibility preset ID.'=>'ID preset wiwo ti a ko mọ.','Get Blocks plugin settings'=>'Gba awọn eto plugin Blok','Read Blocks Dashboard feature switches and non-secret Settings values, with labels and exact setting names. These switches enable whole features, not role-specific block permissions or individual block defaults.'=>'Ka awọn switch ẹya Dashboard Blok ati awọn iye Eto ti kii ṣe ikọkọ, pẹlu awọn aami ati awọn orukọ eto gangan. Awọn switch wọnyi mu awọn ẹya gbogbo ṣiṣẹ, kii ṣe awọn igbanilaaye blok ti o da lori ipa tabi awọn aiyipada blok kọọkan.','Update Blocks plugin settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto plugin Blok','Change supplied Blocks Dashboard feature switches or non-secret Settings values. Unspecified fields are preserved. Use get-plugin-settings first to identify the setting. API keys and mail configuration are not supported.'=>'Yipada awọn switch ẹya Dashboard Blok ti a pese tabi awọn iye Eto ti kii ṣe ikọkọ. Awọn aaye ti a ko sọ ni a pa. Lo get-plugin-settings akọkọ lati mọ eto naa. Awọn bọtini API ati iṣeto imeeli ko ni atilẹyin.','Get role block permissions'=>'Gba awọn igbanilaaye blok ipa','Read Block Permissions (Block Access): enabled and disabled editor blocks for one existing role. Returns known block names and role choices. This controls block availability, not publishing capabilities.'=>'Ka Awọn Igbanilaaye Blok (Iwọle Blok): awọn blok olootu ti a mu ṣiṣẹ ati ti a pa fun ipa kan ti o wa. Pada awọn orukọ blok ti a mọ ati awọn aṣayan ipa. Eyi n ṣakoso wiwa blok, kii ṣe awọn agbara ifiweranṣẹ.','Update role block permissions'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn igbanilaaye blok ipa','Enable or disable specified known editor blocks for one role on the Block Permissions screen. Preserves other roles and blocks. Unknown roles and blocks are rejected. This does not change WordPress role capabilities or existing content.'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ tabi pa awọn blok olootu ti a mọ ti a sọ fun ipa kan lori iboju Awọn Igbanilaaye Blok. Pa awọn ipa miiran ati awọn blok. Awọn ipa ati awọn blok ti a ko mọ ni a kọ. Eyi ko yipada awọn agbara ipa WordPress tabi akoonu to wa.','Get Block Controls settings'=>'Gba awọn eto Iṣakoso Blok','Read available Block Controls visibility rule types and their global enabled state. Includes per-block active/inactive lists. These are global controls; saved visibility presets use list-control-presets.'=>'Ka awọn iru ofin wiwo Iṣakoso Blok ti o wa ati ipo ti wọn ti mu ṣiṣẹ ni agbaye. pẹlu awọn atokọ ti n ṣiṣẹ / ti ko ṣiṣẹ fun ọkọọkan blok. Awọn wọnyi jẹ awọn iṣakoso agbaye; awọn presets wiwo ti a fipamọ lo list-control-presets.','Update Block Controls settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto Iṣakoso Blok','Enable or disable supplied global visibility rule types on Block Controls. Preserves unspecified controls and per-block lists. Does not change individual posts or saved preset definitions.'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ tabi pa awọn iru ofin wiwo ti a pese ni agbaye lori Iṣakoso Blok. Pa awọn iṣakoso ti a ko sọ ati awọn atokọ fun ọkọọkan blok. Ko yipada awọn ifiweranṣẹ kọọkan tabi awọn itumọ preset ti a fipamọ.','Update Extra Blocks defaults'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn aiyipada Extra Blocks','Change supplied default fields for one Extra Blocks type, preserving other defaults. First use get-block-configuration for exact block keys, field labels, types, choices and ranges. Affects newly inserted blocks only, not existing post content.'=>'Yipada awọn aaye aiyipada ti a pese fun iru Extra Blocks kan, pa awọn aiyipada miiran. Lo get-block-configuration ni akọkọ fun awọn bọtini blok gangan, awọn aami aaye, awọn iru, awọn aṣayan ati awọn iwọn. N ni ipa lori awọn blok ti a fi kun tuntun nikan, kii ṣe akoonu ifiweranṣẹ to wa.','Use dry_run to validate and return proposed values without saving.'=>'Lo dry_run lati jẹrisi ati pada awọn iye ti a dabaa laisi fipamọ.','Use the exact setting type returned by get-plugin-settings.'=>'Lo iru eto gangan ti a pada nipasẹ get-plugin-settings.','Unknown control or non-boolean value.'=>'Ìṣàkóso àìmọ̀ tàbí iye ti kì í ṣe boolean.','Unknown role.'=>'Ìṣẹ́ àìmọ̀.','Unknown block or non-boolean value. Open Block Permissions in the editor to refresh its block catalogue.'=>'Bọ́ọ́kì àìmọ̀ tàbí iye ti kì í ṣe boolean. Pẹ̀lú ìmúlẹ̀ Block Permissions nínú olùtúpalẹ̀ láti tún ìkàwé bọ́ọ́kì rẹ̀ ṣe.','Unknown block configuration key. Use get-block-configuration first.'=>'Bọ́ọ́kì ìtòsọ́nà àìmọ̀. Lo get-block-configuration kọ́kọ́.','Unknown configuration field: %s'=>'Àkọlé ìtòsọ́nà àìmọ̀: %s','Configuration values must be scalar.'=>'Àwọn iye ìtòsọ́nà gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ scalar.','Configuration number is outside its supported range.'=>'Nọ́mbà ìtòsọ́nà wa níta àkójọpọ̀ rẹ̀.','Checkbox values must be boolean or 0/1.'=>'Àwọn iye Checkbox gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ boolean tàbí 0/1.','Unknown configuration choice.'=>'Àṣàyàn ìtòsọ́nà àìmọ̀.','Discover visibility preset fields'=>'Ṣàwárí àyè àfihàn àtọkànwá','Discover native visibility preset rule types, fields and choices. Rules within a set use AND; sets use OR. Read a saved preset with list-control-presets before changing it.'=>'Ṣàwárí àwọn ìsọ̀kan àfihàn àtọkànwá, àwọn àkọlé àti àwọn àṣàyàn. Àwọn ìlànà nínú àtòjọ kan lo AND; àwọn àtòjọ lo OR. Ka àfihàn ti a fipamọ́ pẹ̀lú list-control-presets kí o tó yí i padà.','Create or update visibility preset'=>'Ṣẹda tàbí ṣe imudojuiwọn àfihàn àtọkànwá','Create a named visibility preset or update an existing ID. Supplied controlSets replace that preset definition; omitted title or controlSets are preserved on update. This does not automatically attach the preset to post blocks.'=>'Ṣẹda àfihàn àtọkànwá ti a npè ní tàbí ṣe imudojuiwọn ID to wa. Àwọn controlSets ti a pese yóò rọ́pò àkọlé àfihàn yẹn; àkọlé tàbí controlSets ti a kò fi kun yóò jẹ́ ki o wa ni imudojuiwọn. Èyí kò so àfihàn yìí mọ́ àwọn bọ́ọ́kì ìsọ̀rọ̀.','Delete visibility preset'=>'Pa àfihàn àtọkànwá','Delete a verified saved visibility preset ID. Existing post references are not rewritten. Read its usage before deleting.'=>'Pa ID àfihàn àtọkànwá ti a fọwọ́si. Àwọn ìtọ́kasi ìsàrò to wa kò ní kọ́ sílẹ̀. Ka ìlò rẹ̀ kí o tó pa án.','Unknown archive taxonomy.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ taxonomy àìmọ̀.','Unknown archive term.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ àìmọ̀.','Unknown role in visibility rule.'=>'Ìṣẹ́ àìmọ̀ nínú ìlànà àfihàn.','Unknown timezone.'=>'Àkókò àìmọ̀.','Invalid schedule date or time.'=>'Ọjọ́ tàbí àkókò ìtọ́kasí kò tọ́.','Minimum width exceeds maximum width.'=>'Iwọn tó kere jùlọ kọja iwọn tó pọ̀jù.','Preset ID not found.'=>'Àkọlé ID kò rí.','A title is required to create a preset.'=>'Àkọlé kan jẹ́ dandan láti ṣẹda àfihàn.','Use the exact input types shown in discovery.'=>'Lo àtọka àkọ́kọ́ tí a fi hàn nínú àwárí.','Use the exact field types shown in discovery.'=>'Lo àwọn irú àkọ́lé tó dájú tí a fi hàn nínú àwárí.','Discover Block Styles fields'=>'Ṣàwárí àwọn àfihàn Block Styles','Read native Block Styles field labels, choices and Pro requirements. CSS is scoped to the saved class name. Read list-custom-styles before updating an ID.'=>'Ka àwọn aami àkọlé Block Styles, àwọn àṣàyàn àti àwọn ibeere Pro. CSS ni a ṣe iwọn sí orúkọ kilasi to fipamọ́. Ka list-custom-styles kí o tó ṣe imudojuiwọn ID.','Create or update Block Style'=>'Ṣẹda tàbí ṣe imudojuiwọn Àṣà Block','Create a named block style or update a verified ID. Unspecified fields and other styles are preserved. Native CSS parsing, sanitization and generated selectors are used. Changing a class name does not rewrite existing post classes.'=>'Ṣẹda àṣà bọ́ọ́kì ti a npè ní tàbí ṣe imudojuiwọn ID to wa. Àwọn àkọlé ti a kò sọ àti àwọn àṣà miran ni a máa ṣetọju. Àwọn ìtúpalẹ̀ CSS, mímú àtọkànwá àti àwọn olùṣàkóso tí a ṣe ni a máa lo. Yíyí orúkọ kilasi kò ní kọ́ àwọn kilasi ìsàrò to wa sílẹ̀.','Delete Block Style'=>'Pa Àṣà Block','Delete a verified style ID. This removes its saved CSS; it does not rewrite existing post classes.'=>'Pa ID àṣà ti a fọwọ́si. Èyí yóò yọ CSS rẹ̀ tí a fipamọ́; kò ní kọ́ àwọn kilasi ìsàrò to wa sílẹ̀.','A style with this class name already exists.'=>'Àṣà kan pẹ̀lú orúkọ kilasi yìí ti wà tẹlẹ.','Style ID not found.'=>'Àkọlé ID kò rí.','Title and CSS class name are required to create a style.'=>'Àkọlé àti orúkọ kilasi CSS jẹ́ dandan láti ṣẹda àṣà.','This saved style has no class name. Supply a valid name to repair it.'=>'Àṣà tí a fipamọ́ yìí kò ní orúkọ kilasi. Pese orúkọ tó tọ́ láti tún un ṣe.','Discover Blocks features and actions'=>'Ṣàwárí àwọn ẹya àti ìṣe Blocks','List Blocks screens, enabled state, required capabilities, edition requirements, field schemas and related read/write actions. Distinguishes role permissions, global switches, new-block defaults and existing post edits. Discovery does not grant access to any action.'=>'Àtòkasí àwọn iboju Blocks, ipò to jẹ́ kó ṣiṣẹ́, àwọn agbara to jẹ́ dandan, àwọn ibeere ẹ̀dá, àwọn àkọlé àgbékalẹ̀ àti àwọn ìṣe ka/ kọ́ to jọmọ. Yàtọ̀ sí àwọn àṣẹ ipa, awọn pátákó àgbáyé, awọn aiyipada bọ́ọ́kì tuntun àti awọn àtúnṣe ìsàrò to wa. Àwárí kò fun ni iraye si eyikeyi ìṣe.','Update block permissions for multiple roles'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn aṣẹ bọ́ọ́kì fún ọpọlọpọ ipa','Update Editor Features for multiple roles'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn Awọn ẹya Olùtúpalẹ̀ fún ọpọlọpọ ipa','Apply the same typed changes to existing roles. Validates every role and field before one settings write, preserving other roles and fields. Use dry_run for proposed values without saving.'=>'Lò àwọn ayipada tó dájú kan náà fún àwọn ipa to wa. Ṣàpèjúwe gbogbo ipa àti àkọlé kí ìkan nínú àwọn eto kọ́, jẹ́ ki awọn ipa àti àkọlé míì wa. Lo dry_run fún àwọn iye ti a dabaa láì fipamọ́.','Dashboard and Settings'=>'Dashboard ati Eto','Extra Blocks defaults for new blocks'=>'Awọn aiyipada Blocks afikun fun awọn bulọọki tuntun','Reusable Blocks and synced patterns'=>'Awọn Blocks ti a le tun lo ati awọn ilana ti a so pọ','Existing post blocks and editor preferences'=>'Awọn bulọọki ifiweranṣẹ to wa ati awọn ayanfẹ olootu','Saved form submissions'=>'Awọn ifisilẹ fọọmu ti a fipamọ','Extra Blocks availability'=>'Wiwa Blocks afikun','Per-block visibility controls'=>'Awọn iṣakoso wiwa fun ọkọọkan bulọọki','Legacy Blocks'=>'Awọn bulọọki atijọ','Role Editor Features'=>'Awọn ẹya Olootu Iṣẹ','Form email settings'=>'Awọn eto imeeli fọọmu','reCAPTCHA settings'=>'awọn eto reCAPTCHA','Content Display default thumbnail'=>'Iboju akoonu aiyipada thumbnail','Each action also checks its native feature, edition and target-object permissions. Required capabilities can vary between reading, assignment and administration.'=>'Gbogbo iṣe naa tun n ṣayẹwo ẹya abinibi rẹ, ẹdi ati awọn igbanilaaye ohun-elo ibi-afẹde. Awọn agbara ti a beere le yato lati kika, ikọkọ ati iṣakoso.','Controls saved successfully!'=>'Awọn iṣakoso ti fipamọ tẹlẹ!','Blocks saved successfully!'=>'Awọn bulọọki ti fipamọ tẹlẹ!','Settings saved successfully!'=>'Awọn eto ti fipamọ tẹlẹ!','Configure display controls that schedule blocks or restrict visibility by user role and other conditions.'=>'Ṣeto awọn iṣakoso ifihan ti o ṣeto awọn bulọọki tabi ṣe idiwọ wiwo nipasẹ ipa olumulo ati awọn ipo miiran.','Presets'=>'Awọn iṣeto','Controls'=>'Awọn iṣakoso','Enable or disable controls for all blocks'=>'Mú ṣiṣẹ tabi pa iṣakoso fun gbogbo awọn bulọọki','Save Blocks'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Bulọọki','Schedule'=>'Akọsilẹ','Choose when to start showing and/or stop showing your blocks.'=>'Yan igba ti o fẹ lati bẹrẹ fihan ati/tabi da fihan awọn bulọọki rẹ duro.','This block control is available on:'=>'Iṣakoso bulọọki yii wa lori:','Widgets'=>'Awọn ohun elo','Site Editor'=>'Olùkọ́ ọ̀rẹ́','User roles'=>'Ipa olumulo','Choose which users can see your blocks.'=>'Yan awọn olumulo wo ni o le rii awọn bulọọki rẹ.','Device Type'=>'Iru Ẹrọ','Choose the device type to show your blocks on.'=>'Yan iru ẹrọ lati fihan awọn bulọọki rẹ lori.','Device Width'=>'Iwọn Ẹrọ','Choose the device width to show your blocks on.'=>'Yan iwọn ẹrọ lati fihan awọn bulọọki rẹ lori.','Term archives'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ àkópọ̀','Choose on which taxonomies and terms archive pages your blocks can be displayed.'=>'Yan lori awọn taxonomy ati awọn oju-iwe ipamọ ọrọ ti bulọọki rẹ le farahan.','Pages'=>'Àwọn Ojú-ìwé','Choose in which pages your blocks can be displayed.'=>'Yan níbi tí àwọn bulọọki rẹ le han.','Browser & Device'=>'Báwọ & Ẹrọ','Choose which browsers and devices can see your blocks.'=>'Yan ẹniti awọn báwọ ati awọn ẹrọ le rii awọn bulọọki rẹ.','Operating System'=>'Eto Isẹ','Choose which operating systems can see your blocks.'=>'Yan awọn eto isẹ tí le rii awọn bulọọki rẹ.','Cookie'=>'Kuki','Show or hide blocks based on cookie values.'=>'Fihan tàbí pa àwọn bulọọki da lori iye kuki.','User Meta'=>'Meta Olumulo','Show or hide blocks based on user meta values.'=>'Fihan tàbí pa àwọn bulọọki da lori iye meta olumulo.','Post Meta'=>'Meta Ifiweranṣẹ','Show or hide blocks based on post meta values.'=>'Fihan tàbí pa àwọn bulọọki da lori iye meta ifiweranṣẹ.','Query String'=>'Ọrọ ìbéèrè','Show or hide blocks based on URL query parameters.'=>'Fihan tàbí pa àwọn bulọọki da lori awọn paramita ìbéèrè URL.','Capabilities'=>'Agbara','Show or hide blocks based on user capabilities.'=>'Fihan tàbí pa àwọn bulọọki da lori awọn agbara olumulo.','Save Controls'=>'Fipamọ Àwọn Iṣakoso','Loading presets...'=>'Loading presets...','Accordion - PublishPress'=>'Accordion - PublishPress','Button - PublishPress'=>'Bọtini - PublishPress','Icon - PublishPress'=>'Aami - PublishPress','Image - PublishPress'=>'Aworan - PublishPress','List - PublishPress'=>'Atokọ - PublishPress','Table - PublishPress'=>'Tebulu - PublishPress','Tabs - PublishPress'=>'Tẹbẹs - PublishPress','Video - PublishPress'=>'Fidio - PublishPress','Columns - PublishPress'=>'Kólọmù - PublishPress','Column - PublishPress'=>'Kólọmù - PublishPress','Contact Form - PublishPress'=>'Fọọmu Ibaṣepọ - PublishPress','Count Up - PublishPress'=>'Ka Soke - PublishPress','Images Slider - PublishPress'=>'Aworan Slider - PublishPress','Info Box - PublishPress'=>'Apoti Alaye - PublishPress','Map - PublishPress'=>'Maapu - PublishPress','Newsletter - PublishPress'=>'Iwe iroyin - PublishPress','Social Links - PublishPress'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ Awujọ - PublishPress','Table of Contents - PublishPress'=>'Tebulu Awọn akoonu - PublishPress','Testimonial - PublishPress'=>'Ẹri - PublishPress','Woo Products - PublishPress'=>'Awọn ọja Woo - PublishPress','Show content in collapsible panels that expand when clicked.'=>'Fihan akoonu ni awọn panẹli ti o le dinku ti o gbooro nigbati a tẹ.','Add a customizable call-to-action button with colors, sizes and icons.'=>'Fi bọtini ipe-si-ìṣe ti a le ṣe aṣa kun pẹlu awọn awọ, iwọn ati awọn aami.','Insert a vector icon from a large library, with size and color controls.'=>'Fi aami vekito kan sinu ile-ikawe nla, pẹlu awọn iṣakoso iwọn ati awọ.','Display an image with extra styling, captions and link options.'=>'Fihan aworan pẹlu aṣa afikun, awọn akọle ati awọn aṣayan ọna asopọ.','Build styled ordered or unordered lists with custom icons.'=>'Kọ awọn atokọ ti a ti ṣe aṣa ti a ti paṣẹ tabi ti a ko paṣẹ pẹlu awọn aami aṣa.','Create responsive tables with styling and per-cell formatting.'=>'Ṣẹda awọn tabili ti o ni ibamu pẹlu aṣa ati fọọmu ni selifu kọọkan.','Organize content into horizontal or vertical tabbed sections.'=>'Ṣeto akoonu si awọn apakan ti o ni awọn taabu ni iwaju tabi ni iha inaro.','Embed a self-hosted or external video with a custom poster image.'=>'Fi fidio ti a ti gbe kalẹ tabi ti ita mọra pẹlu aworan afihan aṣa.','Lay out content in flexible, responsive multi-column rows.'=>'Ṣeto akoonu ni awọn ila pupọ ti o ni irọrun, ti o ni ibamu.','A single column used inside the Columns block.'=>'Ọkan kòlùmù kan ti a lo ninu bulọọki Awọn Kòlùmù.','Wrap blocks in a styled container with background, padding and borders.'=>'Yika awọn bulọọki ni apoti ti a ṣe aṣa pẹlu abẹlẹ, padding ati awọn aala.','Add a customizable contact form that emails submissions to you.'=>'Fi fọọmu olubasọrọ ti a le ṣe aṣa kun ti o fi awọn ifisilẹ ranṣẹ si ọ nipasẹ imeeli.','Animate numbers counting up to highlight stats and milestones.'=>'Ṣe awọn nọmba ti n ka soke lati ṣe afihan awọn iṣiro ati awọn ibi-afẹde.','Show multiple images in a responsive carousel slider.'=>'Fihan ọpọlọpọ awọn aworan ni slider carousel ti o ni ibamu.','Present an icon or image with a heading and text in a styled box.'=>'Ṣafihan aami tabi aworan pẹlu akọle ati ọrọ ninu apoti ti a ṣe aṣa.','Embed an interactive Google Map with custom markers.'=>'Fi maapu Google ti o ni ibaraenisepo sinu pẹlu awọn ami aṣa.','Collect email subscribers with a customizable signup form.'=>'Gba awọn alabapin imeeli pẹlu fọọmu iforukọsilẹ ti a le ṣe aṣa.','Display a front-end login and registration form.'=>'Fihan fọọmu wiwọle ati iforukọsilẹ iwaju.','Add a styled site search bar anywhere on your pages.'=>'Fi iboju wiwa aaye ti a ṣe aṣa kun nibikibi lori awọn oju-iwe rẹ.','Link to your social profiles with a row of social icons.'=>'So ọna si awọn profaili awujọ rẹ pẹlu ila ti awọn aami awujọ.','Generate an automatic table of contents from your headings.'=>'Ṣẹda tabili akoonu aifọwọyi lati awọn akọle rẹ.','Showcase customer testimonials with photo, name and role.'=>'Fihan awọn ẹri alabara pẹlu fọto, orukọ ati ipa.','Display WooCommerce products in a customizable grid.'=>'Fihan awọn ọja WooCommerce ni nẹtiwọọki ti a le ṣe akanṣe.','Display a countdown timer to a specific date or event.'=>'Fihan akoko idaduro si ọjọ tabi iṣẹlẹ kan pato.','Highlight a single feature with an icon, title and description.'=>'Ṣe afihan ẹya kan pẹlu aami, akọle ati apejuwe.','Compare pricing plans side by side with features and buttons.'=>'Ṣe afiwe awọn eto idiyele lẹgbẹẹ ara wọn pẹlu awọn ẹya ati awọn bọtini.','Manage the extra PublishPress blocks available in the editor, including content displays, sliders, buttons, icons, tabs, accordions, and more.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn bulọọki PublishPress afikun ti o wa ninu olootu, pẹlu awọn ifihan akoonu, awọn olutẹ, awọn bọtini, awọn aami, awọn taabu, awọn akordeon, ati diẹ sii.','About the %s block'=>'Nipa bulọọki %s','Enable / disable this block'=>'Mu / pa bulọọki yii ṣiṣẹ','Enable %s block'=>'Mu %s bulọọki ṣiṣẹ','Configure Recent Posts block'=>'Ṣeto bulọọki Awọn ifiweranṣẹ to ṣẹṣẹ','Configure'=>'Ṣeto','Edit %s block settings'=>'Ṣatunkọ awọn eto bulọọki %s','Edit'=>'Ṣatunkọ','Save'=>'Fipamọ','No blocks available. Please go to a post edit (without saving either modifying anything). Then come back to Block Settings to see the blocks list.'=>'Ko si awọn bulọọki ti o wa. Jọwọ lọ si ṣiṣatunkọ ifiweranṣẹ (lai fipamọ tabi yipada ohunkohun). Lẹhinna pada si Eto Bulọọki lati wo atokọ bulọọki.','Content Display'=>'Ifihan Akọkọ','Default thumbnail'=>'Àtọkànwá àwòrán kekere','Default post thumbnail'=>'Iboju aiyipada ti ifiweranṣẹ','Select default thumbnail'=>'Yan iṣafihan aiyipada','Reset thumbnail to default'=>'Tun iboju aiyipada pada si iboju aiyipada','Reset to default'=>'Tun ṣeto si àtọkànwá','Set the default post thumbnail to use in Content Display blocks for posts without a featured image.'=>'Ṣeto aworan iṣafihan ifiweranṣẹ aiyipada lati lo ninu awọn bulọọki Ifihan Akoonu fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ laisi aworan ti a ṣe afihan.','Use this image'=>'Lo aworan yii','Saving... Do not close this window!'=>'Fipamọ... Ma pa window yi!','Saved successfully!'=>'Fipamọ ni aṣeyọri!','Error: changes could not be saved.'=>'Aṣiṣe: awọn ayipada ko le fipamọ.','block'=>'bulọọki','Add new style'=>'Fi aṣa tuntun kun','Create and manage custom CSS styles that editors can quickly apply to blocks.'=>'Ṣẹda ati ṣakoso awọn aṣa CSS aṣa ti awọn olootu le yara lo si awọn bulọọki.','Preview'=>'Iworan','Example text with this style'=>'Apeere ọrọ pẹlu aṣa yii','View Extended Preview'=>'Wo Iworan Gbooro','Class name'=>'Orukọ kilasi','This option help you identify specific custom styles in the list
                                            (usually set this same as the custom style\'s background color)'=>'Aṣayan yii n ṣe iranlọwọ fun ọ lati mọ awọn ara aṣa pato ninu atokọ
                                            (nigbagbogbo ṣeto eyi kanna bi awọ abẹlẹ ti ara aṣa)','Identification color'=>'Awọ idanimọ','Style Builder'=>'Olùkó àṣà','Custom CSS'=>'CSS Aṣa','Press Esc, then Tab, to leave the editor.'=>'Tẹ Esc, lẹhinna Tab, lati kuro ni olootu.','Hint: Use "Ctrl + Space" for auto completion'=>'Iṣeduro: Lo "Ctrl + Space" fun ipari aifọwọyi','Headings'=>'Awọn akọle','Links'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ','Media'=>'Media','Containers'=>'Awọn apoti','Interactive'=>'Ibi iṣẹ','Save styles'=>'Fipamọ awọn aṣa','Use this dashboard to turn PublishPress Blocks features on or off.'=>'Lo dashboard yii lati yi awọn ẹya PublishPress Blocks ṣiṣẹ tabi pa.','This feature adds display controls for blocks. You can schedule when blocks are shown, and add user role restrictions.'=>'Iṣẹ yii nfi awọn iṣakoso ifihan kun fun awọn bulọọki. O le ṣeto nigbati awọn bulọọki han, ati fi awọn ihamọ ipa olumulo kun.','You can control who can use each block, including default WordPress blocks.'=>'O le ṣakoso ẹni ti o le lo ọkọọkan awọn bulọọki, pẹlu awọn bulọọki WordPress aiyipada.','You can add your own CSS styles for your blocks. Anyone editing posts can quickly add the styles to blocks.'=>'O le fi awọn aṣa CSS ti tirẹ kun fun awọn bulọọki rẹ. Ẹnikẹni ti o n ṣatunkọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ le ni kiakia ṣafikun awọn aṣa si awọn bulọọki.','You can scan the posts on your website for blocks usage.'=>'O le ṣawari awọn ifiweranṣẹ lori oju opo wẹẹbu rẹ fun lilo awọn bulọọki.','This feature enables a submenu to manage your Reusable Blocks.'=>'Ẹya yii n mu submenu wa lati ṣakoso Awọn Bulọọki Tuntun rẹ.','Automatically insert reusable blocks into posts based on position, categories, tags, and other criteria.'=>'Fi awọn bulọọki ti a tun lo laifọwọyi sinu awọn ifiweranṣẹ da lori ipo, awọn ẹka, awọn aami, ati awọn itọkasi miiran.','Enable extra blocks including content displays, sliders, buttons, icons, tabs, accordions, and more.'=>'Mu awọn bulọọki afikun ṣiṣẹ pẹlu awọn ifihan akoonu, awọn olutọpa, awọn bọtini, awọn aami, awọn taabu, awọn akordeon, ati diẹ sii.','Adds an "Add Note" button to the block editor toolbar and a Post Notes admin page to review all notes across your posts (requires WordPress 6.9+).'=>'Ṣe afikun bọtini "Fikun Ifiranṣẹ" si ọpa olootu bulọọki ati oju-iwe iṣakoso Ifiranṣẹ lati ṣe ayẹwo gbogbo awọn ifiranṣẹ kọja awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ (nbeere WordPress 6.9+).','Find all the editorial notes for your posts in one place.'=>'Wa gbogbo awọn akọsilẹ olootu fun awọn ifiweranṣẹ rẹ ni ibi kan.','Filter by post type'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ post type','All post types'=>'Gbogbo iru ifiweranṣẹ','Filter by note status'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ nipasẹ ipo akọsilẹ','All statuses'=>'Gbogbo ipo','Open'=>'Ṣí','Resolved'=>'Ti yanju','Search by post title'=>'Wa nipasẹ akọle ifiweranṣẹ','Search by post title…'=>'Wa nipasẹ akọle ifiweranṣẹ…','Filter'=>'Àlẹmọ','Reset'=>'Tunṣe','%d note'=>'%d akọsilẹ' . "\0" . '','No notes found.'=>'Ko si awọn akọsilẹ ti a rii.','(no title)'=>'(ko si akọle)','(deleted)'=>'(pada sẹyin)','Block Features'=>'Awọn ẹya Bulọọki','Legacy'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe atijọ','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','Maps'=>'Awọn maapu','Email & Forms'=>'Imeeli & Awọn fọọmu','reCAPTCHA'=>'reCAPTCHA','Data Export'=>'Gbigbe Data','Extra Blocks settings'=>'Awọn eto Blocks afikun','Select Role'=>'Yan Ipa','Disable all block adding'=>'Dena gbogbo fifi bulọọki kun','Prevent users in %1s role from adding new block to posts.'=>'Ṣe idiwọ awọn olumulo ninu ipa %1s lati fi bulọọki tuntun kun si awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','Disable the Pattern Directory'=>'Dena Awọn itọsọna Àpẹẹrẹ','Disable the pattern directory for users in %1s role.'=>'Pa ọna àkọsílẹ́ fún àwọn olumulo ní ipa %1s.','Disable the Openverse'=>'Pa Openverse','Disable Openverse for users in %1s role.'=>'Pa Openverse fún àwọn olumulo ní ipa %1s.','Save Block Features Settings'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Eto Awọn ẹya Block','Download Contacts Form data'=>'Gbigba data Fọọmu Awọn olubasọrọ','Data stored through Contact form blocks.'=>'Data tí a fipamọ́ nipasẹ awọn bulọọki fọọmu olubasọrọ.','Download Contact Form data as CSV'=>'Gba data Fọọmu Ibaraẹnisọrọ bi CSV','CSV'=>'CSV','Download Contact Form data as JSON'=>'Gba data Fọọmu Ibaraẹnisọrọ bi JSON','JSON'=>'JSON','Download Newsletter Form data'=>'Gbigba data Fọọmu Iwe iroyin','Data stored through Newsletter form blocks.'=>'Data tí a fipamọ́ nipasẹ awọn bulọọki fọọmu iwe iroyin.','Download Newsletter Form data as CSV'=>'Gba data Fọọmu Iwe iroyin bi CSV','Download Newsletter Form data as JSON'=>'Gba data Fọọmu Iwe iroyin bi JSON','These email settings apply to messages sent through PublishPress Contact form block.'=>'Awọn eto imeeli wọnyi lo si awọn ifiranṣẹ ti a firanṣẹ nipasẹ bulọọki fọọmu olubasọrọ PublishPress.','Sender name'=>'Orukọ oluranse','Sender email'=>'Imeeli oluranse','Email title'=>'Akọle imeeli','Email receiver'=>'Olugba imeeli','Save Form Settings'=>'Fipamọ́ Àwọn Eto Fọọmu','Blocks icon color'=>'Àwọ́ àwòrán bulọọki','Apply in admin to blocks from PublishPress Blocks plugin.'=>'Lo ninu iṣakoso si awọn bulọọki lati PublishPress Blocks plugin.','Save Settings'=>'Fipamọ Eto','These older blocks are turned off by default on new sites. Enable any you want to use in the editor.'=>'Awọn bulọọki atijọ wọnyi ti wa ni pipade laifọwọyi lori awọn aaye tuntun. Mu eyikeyi ti o fẹ lo ninu olootu.','Enable the %s block'=>'Mu bulọọki %s ṣiṣẹ','Legacy Features'=>'Awọn ẹya atijọ','Older features, turned off by default on new sites.'=>'Awọn ẹya atijọ, ti wa ni pipade laifọwọyi lori awọn aaye tuntun.','Font styles'=>'Awọn aza fọnti','Enable font settings for supported blocks'=>'Mu awọn eto fọnti ṣiṣẹ fun awọn bulọọki ti a ṣe atilẹyin','Gallery lightbox'=>'Ilẹ-iṣẹ aworan','Open gallery images as a lightbox style popup'=>'Ṣí awọn aworan àwòrán gẹgẹbi popup aṣa lightbox','Image caption'=>'Àkíyèsí aworan','Disabled'=>'Ti pa','Overlay'=>'Ẹ̀ka àfihàn','Display caption text on images loaded as lightbox in galleries.'=>'Fihan ọrọ àkíyèsí lori awọn aworan ti a gbe wọle gẹgẹbi lightbox ni awọn àwòrán àwòrán.','Save Legacy Settings'=>'Fipamọ Eto Atijọ','Google API key'=>'Bọtini Google API','How to create a Google API Key'=>'Báwo ni a ṣe lè dá Google API Key ṣẹ','A Google API key is required to use the Map block without any warning.'=>'A nilo Google API key lati lo àpótí Map láìṣe ìkìlọ̀ kankan.','Save Maps Settings'=>'Fipamọ́ Àtọ́kànwá Maps','Block toolbar icon'=>'Aami irinṣẹ bulọọki','Show an "Add note" icon in the block toolbar (next to Bold, Italic and Link). It opens the WordPress Notes feature for the selected block.'=>'Fi aami "Fi akọsilẹ kun" han ninu ọpa igbimọ (ni ẹgbẹ Bold, Italic ati Link). O ṣii ẹya Awọn akọsilẹ WordPress fun bulọọku ti a yan.','Save Post Notes Settings'=>'Fipamọ Eto Awọn akọsilẹ Ifiweranṣẹ','Use the Google reCAPTCHA to avoid spam in PublishPress Blocks forms. Get credentials for your domain by registering %shere%s.'=>'Lo Google reCAPTCHA lati yago fun spam ni awọn fọọmu PublishPress Blocks. Gba awọn iwe-ẹri fun agbegbe rẹ nipa iforukọsilẹ %shere%s.','Enable reCAPTCHA'=>'Mú reCAPTCHA ṣiṣẹ','Site key'=>'Bọtìnì aaye','Secret key'=>'Bọtìnì aṣírí','Language'=>'Èdè','Auto detect'=>'Ìmúlẹ̀ àautomátíkì','Language codes list'=>'Àtòjọ kóòdù èdè','Theme'=>'Kíkọ́','Light'=>'Fọ́tò','Invisible'=>'Kò hàn','We strongly recommend not using Invisible reCAPTCHA if you have more than 1 Newsletter or Contact forms block in a page.'=>'A ni imọran gidigidi pe ki o ma lo Invisible reCAPTCHA ti o ba ni diẹ sii ju 1 bulọọki Iwe iroyin tabi Fọọmu olubasọrọ ninu oju-iwe kan.','Save reCAPTCHA Settings'=>'Fipamọ́ Àtọ́kànwá reCAPTCHA','Countdown'=>'Ìkànsí','Easily create a customizable countdown.'=>'Rọrun láti dá ìkànsí kan ti a lè ṣe àtúnṣe.','Pricing Table'=>'Tábìlì Iye','Easily create a customizable pricing table.'=>'Rọrun láti dá tábìlì iye kan ti a lè ṣe àtúnṣe.','Feature'=>'Àmì','Use block to create a list inside the Feature List" block.'=>'Lo àkóónú láti dá àkójọpọ̀ nínú àkóónú Àmì" àkóónú.','Feature List'=>'Àkójọpọ̀ Àmì','Gutenberg is not detected! Activate 